.assignment-survey-quality-legend.small
  %p.text-muted.mb-2
    OG grades each average so you can scan healthy vs at risk. Hover an icon for details, including disagree-side counts and small-sample notes.
  .d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-3
    - AssignmentSurveys::QualitySignal::BANDS.each do |band|
      %span.d-inline-flex.align-items-center.gap-1
        %i.bi{class: [band[:icon], "assignment-survey-quality-icon", "assignment-survey-quality-#{band[:key]}"], "aria-hidden": "true"}
        %span= band[:label]
    %span.d-inline-flex.align-items-center.gap-1
      %i.bi.bi-exclamation-triangle-fill.assignment-survey-quality-caution{"aria-hidden": "true"}
      %span Healthy/Incredible mean with disagree-side responses
